;; X06-guest-xcode: added to xcode.sb for p2. Throwaway.
;; ios-test, ios-uitest: with every rule above, the tests run and pass, but
;; xcodebuild doesn't exit, and no denial is logged. Narrower sets tried
;; (results/g3-bisect-tasks.jsonl) all hung: file* alone, file* with mach*
;; and network*, file* with mach*, ipc* and process*, file* with network*,
;; signal, iokit*, sysctl* and system*. This is the set that let it finish.
(allow file* mach* ipc* network* signal process* iokit* sysctl* system*
       user-preference* darwin-notification-post job-creation lsopen
       appleevent-send generic-issue-extension authorization-right-obtain)
